#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:37
msgid ""
"Record this once the item is physically back. It updates warehouse stock, so "
"the count only stays true if the gear is actually in your hands."
msgstr "Zapíšte, až keď je vec fyzicky späť. Aktualizuje skladovú evidenciu, takže stav sedí len vtedy, ak vybavenie naozaj máte."

#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:42
msgid ""
"Opens a manager charge review at the issued stock value. If the manager "
"approves it, the amount comes off this worker's pay."
msgstr "Otvorí manažérske posúdenie úhrady v hodnote vydanej položky. Ak ho manažér schváli, suma sa pracovníkovi strhne zo mzdy."

#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:42
msgid ""
"This flags the item as unreturned and opens a manager charge review at its "
"issued stock value."
msgstr ""
"Označí položku ako nevrátenú a otvorí manažérsku kontrolu úhrady v hodnote "
"vydaných zásob."

#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:42
msgid "Flag unreturned"
msgstr "Označiť ako nevrátené"

#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:48
msgid ""
"Returning means the item is back in your hands; flagging it unreturned can "
"put the money on this worker's pay."
msgstr "Vrátenie znamená, že vec máte späť v rukách; označenie ako nevrátené môže sumu preniesť na mzdu pracovníka."

#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:60
msgid ""
"Hand the item over as you record it. It leaves the warehouse count and "
"becomes this worker's responsibility to return."
msgstr "Vec odovzdajte v momente, keď ju zapisujete. Odchádza zo skladovej evidencie a pracovník zodpovedá za jej vrátenie."

#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:60
msgid "Issue equipment"
msgstr "Vydať vybavenie"

#: templates/panels/logistics_equipment.html:62
msgid "Gear physically changes hands and leaves the warehouse count."
msgstr "Vybavenie fyzicky mení majiteľa a odchádza zo skladovej evidencie."

